This directory contains script files to generate Cypress
presynthesis and postsynthesis libraries pertinent to the
Warp design tool.

These scripts currently have support for the following simulators.

    Model Technology:
	vsys_std:	generate STD_LOGIC type libraries for ModelSim
	vsysprim:	generate post-systhesis libraries for ModelSim

    SymphonyEDA
	symp_std.bat:	generate STD_LOGIC type libraries for VHDL Simili
	sympprim.bat:	generate post-systhesis libraries for VHDL Simili

    Aldec-HDLSim
	update_cypress.do:	generate STD_LOGIC type libraries for Aldec
	update_primitive.do:	generate post-systhesis libraries for Aldec


In additon to the VHDL libraries, two scripts are included to help
generate the Verilog "libraries" for Model Technology and Aldec:

    Model Technology:
	vsys_vlg:			generate cyp_vlg pre-synthesis library
	vsyspvlg:			generate prim_vlg post-synthesis library

    Aldec-HDLSim
	update_cypress_verilog.do:	generate cypress_verilog library
	update_primitive_verilog.do:	generate ovi_cypress library

These script files are intended to help the user build Cypress
libraries for pre-synthesis or post-synthesis.  They are not
intended to be a complete solution for all possible simulators.

For ModelSim, these script files can be run under UNIX by csh,
or for UNIX or Windows, the script can be run from the command GUI.
The SymphonyEDA are Windows/DOS batch files and can be run from
the DOS command line.  The Aldec .do files are run from within
the Aldec GUI similar to other Aldec macro files.

